  "body": "Tucked privately away at the end of a long driveway, 7D Atkin Avenue feels wonderfully removed from the pace of the city, yet everything that makes Mission Bay so desirable is right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nSurrounded by established greenery and birdsong, this three-bedroom, two-bathroom home offers a peaceful, leafy retreat in one of Auckland's most sought-after coastal neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor is designed around easy everyday living, with open-plan kitchen, dining and living spaces connecting naturally and creating a relaxed hub for the home. Step outside and the setting becomes the real surprise. Private, green and sheltered by mature trees, the garden provides a lovely sense of escape that is increasingly difficult to find this close to the city.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, three bedrooms and two bathrooms provide separation from the main living areas, making the layout equally appealing for families, professionals or those wanting room for guests or working from home.\r\n\r\nPracticality hasn't been forgotten, with a single internal-access garage with electric door, additional off-street parking and a garden shed. \r\n\r\nAnd then there's the location. Leave the car at home and embrace the Mission Bay lifestyle, with the waterfront, beach, cafes, bars and restaurants of Mission Bay all within easy reach. Whether it's a morning walk along the waterfront, dinner by the beach or simply coming home and disappearing into your own private green sanctuary, this is a home that offers the best of both worlds.\r\n\r\nDEADLINE SALE: Closes 3:00pm, Wednesday 30 September 2026 (Unless Sold Prior).\r\n\r\n*Please note that photos with staging are virtually staged.",
